[2025-06-26 14:33:17] local.DEBUG: Single Media JSON: {"data":{"Media":{"id":10278,"type":"ANIME","title":{"english":"The Idol Master","romaji":"THE IDOLM@STER"},"coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx10278-FnbOihGuSpfc.jpg"},"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10278-dbY42xsioBGr.jpg","description":"765 Production Studio manages the unique talents of 13 professional idols as they slowly make their way to the top and become country-wide celebrities. But the girls' journey is far from just fun and games: hard work, sweat, and tears are some of the prerequisites needed to flourish in this industry—and for 765 Pro in particular, a watchful eye out for their rival, the infamous 961 Production.

